  "description": "⭐ <strong><em>Smithsonian Starstruck: An Immersive Experience</em></strong> is a first-of-its-kind virtual reality adventure that doesn't just show you the universe — it places you inside it. Launching in London on June 26th, and <strong>created in collaboration with the Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory</strong>, the experience takes visitors on a breathtaking journey through the cosmos, from dazzling galaxies to the edge of a black hole.<br><br><strong>Now open at the Science Museum in London. Witness the life of stars in breathtaking detail. Book your journey today.</strong><br><ul><li> 🎫 <strong>A free Science Museum admission ticket is required to enter,</strong>&nbsp;book yours at this link <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/events?view=calendar&amp;kid=441&amp;promo=74788\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>Stand beside the Smithsonian’s Whipple Observatory, under a sky alive with constellations.</li><li>Climb aboard powerful telescopes and uncover the universe’s greatest mysteries.</li><li>Listen to the Sun's vibrations and behold solar flares 30 times larger than Earth.</li><li>Explore an exoplanet where volcanoes erupt and diamonds glitter beneath the surface.</li><li>Witness a spectacular supernova as star stuff is recycled into new stars and planets.</li><li>Venture to the edge of a supermassive black hole as it pulls a star into its grasp.</li></ul><br><strong>General Info:</strong><br> 📅 Dates &amp; Time: Select your date &amp; time directly in the calendar<br> 📍 Location: Science Museum, Floor 1, Exhibition Rd, South Kensington, London SW7 2DD<br> ⌛ Duration: approx. 1 hour (including a 40-minute VR experience)<br> 👤 Age requirement: 10+<br> 👥 Group Size: Up to 6 guests may enter at a time. Groups of 6+ will stagger entry every 3 minutes.<br> 💰 Price: Tickets start at £15.00<br> 🎫In addition to your paid ticket, you will need a free Science Museum admission ticket to enter the museum. The admission ticket can be booked at this <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/events?view=calendar&amp;kid=441&amp;promo=74788\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">link</a><br> ♿ Accessibility: We are committed to ensuring all visitors can enjoy the experience<br> ❓ Please consult our <a href=\"https://smithsonianstarstruck.com/london/#faqs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>FAQ page</u></a><br> 🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Smithsonian Starstruck: An Immersive Experience <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/663479\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br><br><strong>Description</strong><br><em>Smithsonian Starstruck: An Immersive Experience</em> is a fully interactive, 3D virtual reality experience that begins at the Smithsonian’s Whipple Observatory before launching visitors into space aboard the world's most powerful telescopes. Developed in close collaboration with the Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory, <em>Starstruck</em> transforms astronomical data and imagery into a breathtaking exploration of the universe. Blending cutting-edge immersive technology with authentic science and cinematic storytelling, <em>Starstruck </em>brings the cosmos within reach like never before.<br>",
